; Five percent is a LOSS BUDGET, not extra stop-loss distance; SLValue is UNCHANGED.
; Two coupled risk inputs set to 5 percent; max lot remains 0.02.
; For USD 200 with planned ~USD 20 at broker min 0.01 lot, expect entry rejection.
; For USD 3000, desired lot may hit the 0.02 lot ceiling; do not claim 5% actual exposure.
; Stop gaps/slippage can exceed the calculated budget. Symbol-metadata fail-open is NOT fixed.
